3. Summary of Modifications by Zachary:
   - Replaced Nezha backend API & WebSocket client with a full Komari Monitor JSON-RPC 2.0 (`/api/rpc2`) and REST (`/api/*`) adapter layer (`src/lib/komari-adapter.ts`).
   - Added real-time multi-currency exchange rate engine and fleet-wide / per-VPS remaining value (剩余价值) calculator (`src/lib/billing-value.ts`).
   - Added 5th overview card for Total Remaining Value and expandable VPS asset leaderboard in `src/components/ServerOverview.tsx`.
   - Added per-server cycle traffic usage progress bar (`src/components/TrafficUsageBar.tsx`) to `ServerCard.tsx` and `ServerCardInline.tsx`.
   - Enhanced server detail subpage (`src/components/ServerDetailOverview.tsx`) with per-VPS remaining value breakdown, cycle traffic progress, virtualization badge, Swap usage, and real-time TCP/UDP/process counters.
   - Added Komari managed theme configuration manifest (`komari-theme.json`) and packaging scripts (`build-theme.sh`).
